    "description": "Multi jet rotary vane wheel water meter with dry mechanical indicating device, designed to measure, memorise and display the volume at metering conditions of water passing through the measurement transducer. Consists of a brass body with connecting screw threads, an inlet strainer and adjusting screw, a gliding ring, a wet measuring unit with an impeller with tangential holes and a shaft, a rotary vane wheel with bush and stone, an O-ring, a pressure plate closing the wet part and a thread ring, a magnetic coupling (wet and dry side), an antimagnetic ring, a mechanical indicating device with 8 numbered drums and 1 pointer, and a plastic head ring with plastic cover. Adjustment is realized by adjusting screw, access protected by sealed screw. Shall be installed in horizontal position only with the indicating device positioned at the top; not designed to measure reverse flow."
